{"ticker":"RCF","symbol":"RCF","instrumentId":3023121,"name":"Rashtriya Chemicals","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Agricultural","about":"Rashtriya Chemicals & Fertilizers Ltd. (RCF) is a major public sector enterprise in India, specializing in the production and distribution of fertilizers and industrial chemicals. The company manufactures a wide range of fertilizers, including urea and complex fertilizers, which play a crucial role in enhancing agricultural productivity across India. RCF also produces industrial chemicals like ammonia, methanol, and nitric acid, catering to various industrial applications. With a strong focus on sustainability, RCF supports the agricultural sector through environmentally friendly products and innovative solutions. It plays a vital role in ensuring food security and promoting balanced nutrient management for Indian farmers.","website":"www.rcfltd.com","location":"Mumbai, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:51:28.364Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":104.44,"changePct":0.4423927678399632,"week52High":149.19,"week52Low":93.63},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹5,762 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹18,466 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"137,922,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"77"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"9,478,663"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"2.24%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.13"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"34.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.12"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.52"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-18%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"12.22"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"6–74"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"8.3%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-8.54"},{"label":"Volume","value":"628,904"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,037,304"},{"label":"Master score","value":"43"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"42"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"25"},{"label":"Group rank